{
  "000": {
    "text": "把这两个分子放到镜子两边。原子一样，连接也一样，可你怎么转，都有一处对不上。身体里的酶也挑方向：同一对镜像分子，效果可能很不一样。怎样让反应多造出需要的那一边？这正是今年诺贝尔化学奖的故事。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261008,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "2840dcde9d1994c761e34b6a6c8f180e063a43133dc6212b2e089a96d103a983",
    "seconds": 15.440041666666668,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "6ac9d226446d80463e7ea27052bfc0c8fdfd7156187e91b6bb14499d1012838a",
    "elapsedSeconds": 92.38917303085327
  },
  "002": {
    "text": "先看中间这个碳原子。它连着四种不同的基团，向空间四个方向伸开。照一面镜子，就得到另一种排列。让两个基团重合，剩下两个却换了位置。这种无法重合的镜像，叫作对映体；分子的这种性质，就叫手性。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261010,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "2d638c9f65271337872ebf321abaf71f18241ca4b387df36b0ff2225be03831e",
    "seconds": 17.12,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "aaf39668b3a46e37e7b73193b751872a1888a843b7bcf7a2497ecdf499fb03ac",
    "elapsedSeconds": 68.54095697402954
  },
  "004": {
    "text": "把尺度拉回生命。蛋白质主要使用L构型的氨基酸，DNA里的糖采用D构型。这里说的是构型，和偏振光往哪边转不能直接画等号。可在缺少手性影响的合成里，两种对映体往往各占一半。最初那一点不平衡，怎么才能留下来？",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261012,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "98c0d2cfe21b331699adf36ce5a9b5a7e83008544506482c4d92c03fe6f64978",
    "seconds": 17.92,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "46753f68d48c25dd472b210167046d7ed647fd2ef141d2c6ecbf290153fea764",
    "elapsedSeconds": 56.504825592041016
  },
  "005b": {
    "text": "催化剂，能让反应走一条更容易的路，完成一轮，还能继续工作。金属周围配位的分子或离子，叫作配体。有手性的配体，会在金属周围摆出有方向的环境。两种镜像产物生成的机会，就有可能拉开差别。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261014,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 0,
    "requestHash": "f921ec1fb2a102f621e36b42f0a909e19f677bf110f91ca613af4006b4924af5",
    "seconds": 16.24,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "da2b3d1a61de67daa904a872a319f4ffc147a3f99d265c3f7038b6c3c5a8c916",
    "elapsedSeconds": 71.38245487213135
  },
  "007": {
    "text": "在这个模型里，左右组合很少参与，右右和左左以相同效率，各做各的那一边。它们的数量比是九比一，产物便能接近九成对一成。把两边所占的百分比相减，就得到对映体过量：起始配体是百分之五十，产物变成百分之八十。曲线弯到直线上方，这就是正非线性效应。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261016,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 0,
    "requestHash": "25e7aa679cdf3a8098fade35404a6f255a224bc584ba50ee848184a124eabcd3",
    "seconds": 23.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "8ed43bc9b6fc4c4f13c22c25e446653478b3d3185062a7e26795978f19788126",
    "elapsedSeconds": 169.0903868675232
  },
  "009": {
    "text": "盯住这一小份产物。补进新的原料，它又能帮忙生成更多同一构型的产物；新产物继续加入催化队伍，下一轮的力量就更大。这就是自催化。再配合体系中的非线性放大，最初很微弱的手性偏向，就能一轮轮积累起来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261017,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "24a29a290b41dc8527791a93c2419921110b9cfe40fa860350e99d9fba716b93",
    "seconds": 16.88,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "e786468367069b51cd4dba4af5779d870f5d7129a3514ce1d5ea7321c5ee8bc2",
    "elapsedSeconds": 52.58059310913086
  },
  "014": {
    "text": "所以，一点点偏差怎样成为清晰的选择？先看催化剂如何组合，再看产物怎样参与下一轮反应。镜子两边几乎相同的分子，就这样走向不同的数量。2026年诺贝尔化学奖，让我们看见了化学放大微小差别的力量。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261022,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "e343a98c79f8a2b680806e2b98ca823a2fabff82cf27868215a813e65a605d93",
    "seconds": 17.12,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "19cd8d1a851bdacbe0d0a57109718aa711dfad6c7367766271b22b217d6d44d5",
    "elapsedSeconds": 52.74186301231384
  },
  "001": {
    "text": "2026年诺贝尔化学奖，授予亨利·卡根和硤合宪三。他们发现了不对称有机合成中的非线性效应与自催化。我们从一对镜像出发，看看一点点左右差异，怎样被反应放大，最后变成几乎清一色的产物。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261209,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "b129c6e7f71541af3967fd4b6e5f301a983714808535c69da198c427693131ed",
    "seconds": 16.32,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "3855661945a40611e09497cc298c9ff23500f3d570f5206b9bba286df4d22af2",
    "elapsedSeconds": 125.50620079040527
  },
  "003": {
    "text": "1848年，路易·巴斯德在显微镜下分拣酒石酸盐的晶体。左边一堆，右边一堆，各自溶进水里。让偏振光穿过去，一瓶让偏振方向向右旋，另一瓶向左旋。镜像结构的差别，就这样变成了一次能测出来的变化。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261111,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 1,
    "requestHash": "632fc0a645c77d7c89fe23cdd377ee3e50c470c1a9c0c91404358cdb012047b5",
    "seconds": 19.280041666666666,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "60159d2ec64dfd2556024fd96f764b70bf01cd4cfdfdc4cdbd980d1bcaa6bc26",
    "elapsedSeconds": 57.06055760383606
  },
  "005": {
    "text": "1953年，查尔斯·弗兰克提出了一个模型。先有能生成手性产物的反应；同一边的产物，能帮助制造更多自己；另一边的产物，又会抑制这条通路。自我促进，加上相互抑制，小小的不平衡就有机会越滚越大。化学家接下来要找到真正的反应。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261113,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 1,
    "requestHash": "a7515997a09253b9b579bd1d48ebbd57e4827bb19ec4a70731f82a044682ceea",
    "seconds": 18.16,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "57b33984b1830209c2e92edc31cb6ab1a1227a4eb59f4c682bd9704ac9b59327",
    "elapsedSeconds": 53.83012890815735
  },
  "006": {
    "text": "一九八六年，亨利·卡根团队发现，催化剂的左右比例，并不总会照搬到产物里。看这个双配体模型：在一大群配体里，右手占四分之三，左手占四分之一。随机两两围到金属旁边，会形成右右、左右、左左三种组合，大约占百分之五十六、三十八和六。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261215,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "66599bb885aef6472bd6320baeccd9028b8beb149582b45c8b0bbfc373fd26ad",
    "seconds": 21.12,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "9fdfa51dae5e285a19fc40d1a71eea8ab8d48aacecdaeadf7310aab82fcfbae2",
    "elapsedSeconds": 110.28123354911804
  },
  "008": {
    "text": "接下来，硤合宪三团队把放大器接成了回路。二异丙基锌，和带着醛基的嘧啶反应，先得到手性的锌醇盐；水解处理后，得到醇。锌醇盐还能催化下一轮加成。1995年的工作，把大约百分之二的初始对映体过量，放大到了百分之八十七。产物开始参与制造自己。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261217,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "4bd5e43207a03abf515af2609848d346dfaf834d38575a2cb8480ab6be65ae53",
    "seconds": 21.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "b1d23c3c9a15da621c1368394196ea050876f0021d2a9134dd8f334c196199c6",
    "elapsedSeconds": 73.07928371429443
  },
  "010": {
    "text": "那第一点偏向从哪来？在不加入外来手性物质的特定实验里，硤合宪三团队反复做了三十七次，有十八次右手占优，十九次左手占优。看这些独立的反应瓶，结果会分向两边。反应能放大选择，却没有把每一瓶都指定成同一个方向。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261219,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "d5de9cc80621194e8c8aa2f8c0f315289d2883a44aa869c683bfd672d572b912",
    "seconds": 18.8,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "9c5d2f707c2131a91a0941b686aea87ee0e14caa1fc40a81390954566a2a28ef",
    "elapsedSeconds": 58.996655225753784
  },
  "011": {
    "text": "二零零三年，硤合宪三团队又把起点推到极限：初始对映体过量，只有百分之零点零零零零五。补加原料，连续三轮，升到百分之五十七、百分之九十九，最后超过百分之九十九点五。注意，这个数衡量的是两边的差，超过百分之九十九点五的过量，对应优势一边超过百分之九十九点七五。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261220,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "349974a5ba7c88d81ef7047ac45245d07830404c1fd78164f8030f93b67ff9d8",
    "seconds": 22.640041666666665,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "56687790344481a26f31f975f4e951f5adf9e9ffb352ba3826a8a993a82a9fad",
    "elapsedSeconds": 70.25097012519836
  },
  "012": {
    "text": "回头看，这两项发现解决的是同一个难题的不同环节。亨利·卡根让人看见催化剂组合怎样放大手性，硤合宪三把产物接回反应做出了自催化放大。非线性曲线能帮助研究者推断催化机制，自催化则让我们在人工体系里研究手性怎样形成。它也留下问题：生命最初走的是哪条路？",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261221,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 700,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "attempt": 2,
    "requestHash": "f34517a69cec37168d182d793074c157b9c5be69b88d716d25699167607b6fb0",
    "seconds": 23.04,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "a5ce339021624f7d8bfc4951b3a820edad21b130fdb900034b52c4680b6eeb33",
    "elapsedSeconds": 71.21344804763794
  },
  "013": {
    "text": "把这条路线放回文献：一九八六年，亨利·卡根团队报告非线性效应；一九九五年，硤合宪三团队把自催化和手性放大连在一起；二零零三年，极低起始偏差的实验又向前走了一步。画面中的三轮结果，来自诺奖官方资料对这项研究的整理。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
